WEBVTT

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.800
Owww...!

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:16.010
Mmm... That's a nice cry you got there!

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.440
This is sad.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.310
I can't do anything. I'm so pathetic...!

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.820
Let's see you...

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.370
take this!

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:37.330
No...! It hurts...!

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:48.260
So, are you ready to give up?!

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:51.800
Everything...

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:54.050
Everything...

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:57.510
started from that day.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.940
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:06.110
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:14.740
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:28.000
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:33.510
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:39.140
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:44.190
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:49.730
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:55.110
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:57.990
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:04.660
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:07.380
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:10.590
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:15.680
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.510
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.600
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:29.110
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:33.740
Sweet Diva Center
Vocal Fan Election!

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:35.550
Episode 01: An Idol Wrestler Is Born!

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.660
Your single vote will
change the girls' fate!

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:39.410
Who will take the
center position this time?!

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:40.740
Will it be Sakura Hagiwara?!

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:45.120
Or will Elena Miyazawa
turn the tables to gain victory?!

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.840
That's the Elena I know! Doing good there!

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.300
Sakura, I'm not going to lose!

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.840
Now, the finisher!

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:59.550
Let's end this with the
move that only we can do...!

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:04.220
- Ice Cream Sault!
- Ice Cream Sault!

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:13.070
Thank you, everyone!

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:17.030
The votes are in! We have a winner!

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.820
And here are our results!

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:21.990
The fourth Sweet Diva Center Vocal...

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.910
top honors go to...

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.830
Sakura Hagiwara!

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:35.090
The center vocal position
goes to Sakura Hagiwara!

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:38.630
The reigning queen has
achieved her fourth victory!

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:41.470
Elena Miyazawa was
only steps away from the top

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:44.390
by just one hundred twenty votes!

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:48.810
Sakura...!

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:51.020
Congratulations!

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.860
But, I won't lose next time!

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:57.860
I'll be ready then!

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.050
- Congrats! Sakura-<i>chan</i>!
- Congrats! Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:17.420
Thanks, Yuho, Aika.

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:19.970
So, what's the secret to
dominating the center vocal position?

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:22.720
More importantly, what's the
secret to your awesome body?

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.390
H-Hey...

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:26.640
- S-Stop it...!
- Wow, you're a lot
more muscular than I thought...

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.600
But, it's so soft...

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:31.020
- Wow! Totally jealous!
- Wow! Totally jealous!

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:34.690
Sakura got her figure from all
the hard training she went through.

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:38.490
She's always doing her
best for the Sweet Diva fans.

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:39.780
For the fans?

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:41.360
Nanami...

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:45.080
She also has a strong rival too... Right?

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:48.250
- Elena-<i>chan</i>! Let me be your student!
- Elena-<i>chan</i>! Let me be your student!

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:49.830
S-Students...?

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.080
Hey! Stop with the touching!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.310
Waiting Room

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.500
All right, everyone. Great job out there!

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:58.800
The Fan Election was a huge success!
Look at all this work we got!

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:00.760
Those are all work?

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:03.090
You beast! Slave driver!

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:05.550
Oh, you're going to say that?

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:09.810
Well then, maybe I'll send
some tough ones your way...

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:12.350
- Girl's professional wrestling?!
- Girl's professional wrestling?!

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.060
That's right. It's a live
broadcast of your one-day tryout.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:18.690
What?! Is that work that idols do?

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:22.530
It may be dangerous,
but it's really popular now!

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:24.910
But, it's scary.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:29.700
It's not like everyone has to
do this. Can I ask someone to take it?

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:32.160
Makoto-<i>san</i>? I can take it.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:33.290
Really?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.670
Sakura, I'm sorry, but can you go to...

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.130
I'll go too!

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.420
Elena...?

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:43.010
It's rare to see you want to
take this type of special program.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:47.760
I can't have Sakura put
any more distance between us!

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:49.560
I can do this too!

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:56.230
So this is the girl's professional
wrestling group, Berserk...

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:59.690
Th-They won't be too
hard on novices like us, right?

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:00.730
Yeah, right.

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:03.450
According to the materials we just got...

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:07.740
Berserk is known for their
serious fights, unlike show wrestling.

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.330
The wrestlers are all
skilled in the arts of wrestling.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:15.420
Some of them are even ranked
in a world circuit called "Shangri-La."

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:20.960
It's safer to think that they won't
teach us nicely, even if this is a TV show.

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:22.170
Let's go.

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:23.800
Okay!

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:28.050
Wow, the place feels intense!

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.730
Elena, thanks.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:41.480
Sakura? Why'd you
volunteer yourself for this program?

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:45.610
Everyone looked scared...

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:50.530
and, I figured this kind of experience
could help Sweet Diva's future.

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:53.870
Our future...

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:57.370
You always put Sweet Diva first, don't you?

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:01.380
That's because this is
the only place I can be myself.

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:03.420
Sakura...

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:05.880
Sakura? Watch me!

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.880
Savage Eagle Pose!

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:09.640
H-Hey, Elena...

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.470
C'mon up, Sakura!

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.260
The cushion here is pretty fun...

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:14.890
What are you doing?!

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:25.110
Hey, isn't that Rio Kazama?

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:30.450
The ring isn't a place to be
fooling around on, you bratty newbie!

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:32.450
Wh-What do you mean, bratty?!

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.040
Oh, excuse me!

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:38.460
We're sorry for going
around without permission.

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.630
What's she thinking?
Is she a wrestler here?

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:48.170
The ring must be a sacred stage for them.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:52.140
It's like the stage where
we stand under the spotlight.

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:57.140
We're going live now. Please standby.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.440
Wow, Sakura-<i>chan</i>, you're so flexible.

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:02.440
Really?

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:06.280
No problem! This is
like the basics of dancing.

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:08.700
Elena-<i>chan</i>, you're looking good there.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.860
Like, did you take classes or something?

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:13.530
It's just a matter of
rhythm and power, right?

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:17.080
We do more than our share of stuff
like this every day during our lessons!

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:18.790
Really...?

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.080
Pro wrestling is easier than I thought.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:25.000
Don't make me laugh. Elena-<i>chan</i>, was it?

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:31.590
I guess it's true that idols
have a few screws loose on the top.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:35.430
Thinking that you know wrestling
without even taking some moves.

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.470
- What...
- What are you saying?!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:42.560
There's no way amateurs like us
could take on a professional's move!

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:45.650
I'll do it. Let's see what
professional moves are like!

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:47.280
Elena?!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:51.950
Come on up.

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:56.200
How's it feel?

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:05.170
Wasn't pro wrestling supposed to be easy?

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:23.690
C'mon! If you don't like this,
try and turn my moves!

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:33.450
Elena, please stop!

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:35.070
Sakura...

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:38.660
Sakura... I don't...

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:41.410
want to lose to you!

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.670
Quit it already!

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:45.500
Elena!

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:47.590
See what happened?

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:51.420
Don't underestimate
pro wrestling, you petty idol!

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:57.760
What? You've got a problem or something?

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:02.180
Sweet Diva doing a pro wrestling tryout?

00:10:02.390 --> 00:10:04.640
I've got nothing to do with it.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.440
Sure you do!

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:10.020
I'm a sports journalist, and
Misaki, you're Berserk's top wrestler!

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:13.110
Don't you think this'll
make for a great interview?

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:16.200
I know you're really into your work, but...

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:18.370
But, we're talking idols here. Idols!

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:21.370
That's exactly like you long ago...

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.080
Whoops... Um, sorry.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:26.170
It's nothing to be sorry about.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.290
What's that?

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:36.760
You've got some nerves.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:40.390
Don't underestimate
us idols! I'll face you next!

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:43.390
Hah! It's the same no
matter who comes at me.

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.270
Don't run, you coward!

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:46.480
What...?

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:51.110
I won't let you go!
I'm going to take Elena's revenge!

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:52.860
Sakura...

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:54.400
Oh?

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:57.280
If you're that serious,
then I'll take you on...

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:00.330
in a <i>Cabellera Contra Cabellera</i> match!

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.200
I'll take you on!

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:09.210
I, Sakura Hagiwara, will fight
the wrestler, Kazama... and win!

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:11.920
Don't say I didn't warn ya.

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:19.800
But... I wonder what
<i>"cabe gelato</i>" is about?

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:29.370
Popular idol to challenge
Girls' Pro Wrestling event?!

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:30.560
I, Sakura Hagiwara, will fight
the wrestler, Kazama... and win!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.170
Sweet Diva Sakura Hagiwara's Surprise Announcement!

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:34.430
A <i>Cabellera Contra Cabellera</i>?
Is Sakura-<i>chan</i> serious?!

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:37.570
No way would an idol
do this kind of match-up!

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:39.870
As I mentioned, all tickets are sold out.

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:42.200
I came from Kagoshima.
No way am I going empty handed!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:45.540
With Sweet Diva, you should be
able to fill the stadium next to here!

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:48.960
I'm sorry, but we
aren't selling tickets here!

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:50.880
I'm sorry!

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:54.000
This isn't going to be
much of a practice today.

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:58.720
Wow! So this is the popularity
of the idol group's center vocal!

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:03.930
Boss! This'll overwrite our
record customer attendance!

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:06.930
I sure hope so.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.480
I'm ready!

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:16.440
I'm sorry, Makoto-<i>san,</i>
for making this into such a big deal...

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:19.860
Well, you're not going to give up
something you've committed yourself to.

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:23.700
I know your personality really well.
Ever since you were a trainee.

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.330
Sakura, it's my fault
that you're going through this...

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.710
That's not it.
Don't let it bother you, Elena.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:37.590
She made fun of idols,
and I couldn't let that go.

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:42.050
Once we're done, let's both
do our best as Sweet Divas again!

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:48.270
Okay.

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:50.690
What's the matter? Is that it?!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:53.480
One more time please!

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:58.740
The match everyone in Japan
has been waiting for is about to start.

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:01.200
The match-up between
Sweet Diva's Sakura Hagiwara...

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:03.910
and Berserk pro wrestler, Rio Kazama,

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:07.870
will be a surprising
<i>Cabellera Contra Cabellera</i> match!

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:11.470
"Sakura Hagiwara"

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:11.710
Ready? Super-cute, Super-cute, Sa-ku-ra!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:15.460
Entering is the challenger,
Sakura Hagiwara!

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:31.060
Get out of here!

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:34.520
You're not gonna get away
with this if you hurt Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:40.570
I know I'm getting in
over my head doing this, but...

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:45.950
I couldn't back down as an idol!

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:49.910
I just need to go in and give it all I've got!

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:53.420
The fight of the era is about to start!

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:05.890
She's doing better than I expected.

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:10.810
If she wins this, tomorrow's
front page would become a sure hit!

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:13.440
I doubt it'll go that well.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.030
You're doing good, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:23.360
Go get her!

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:27.450
- I can do this!
- Is that it...?

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:32.290
A real kick... looks like this!

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:41.420
Alright then. It's payback time!

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:45.180
Wrestling moves...

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.850
need to have at least this much flair!

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:57.730
Owww...!

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:00.070
Sakura! Do your best!

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:06.450
My waist... is going to break!

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:08.910
Mmm... That's a nice cry you got there!

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:12.290
I've gotta hand it to you, Ms. Idol!

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:15.790
Ouch!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:21.840
Go Hagiwara!

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:23.840
It hurts...!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.990
"Sakura Hagiwara"

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.190
Let's see you...

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:41.060
take this!

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.610
Ow...!

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:53.450
Can't... breathe...?!

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:57.500
It's not time... for bed yet!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:04.340
So, are you ready to give up?!

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:15.970
Well then, I better go
with a move fit for an idol!

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:19.270
No!

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:23.060
A perfect move for a pathetic idol like you!

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:25.610
No...!

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:28.280
Stop...!

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:32.370
Whoa! It's her Shame Hold!

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:34.990
Leave it to Rio Kazama!
She's got no mercy!

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:40.210
A national idol with her
crotch wide open? Sweet!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:42.330
No...!

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:50.090
N-No! Don't take shots with me like this!

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:52.680
Please...!

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:58.430
So, do you finally understand

00:16:58.640 --> 00:17:01.100
how strong you are and
what you thought you could do?

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:02.650
Just give up!

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:04.610
I-I don't want to...!

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:08.360
I can't give up! I don't want to lose!

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:09.740
I see...

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:13.160
So, you've got a
strong conviction of your own...

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.160
Alright. Then I'll
shatter that along with you!

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.010
Rio's special move, the Sleeper Hold!

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:31.760
That's not good! It's locked in!

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:44.190
I don't want to lose!

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:47.320
I don't want to lose...

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:52.400
I don't... want to lose...

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:54.660
I don't... want to...

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:57.280
Don't... want...

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:04.960
Sakura!

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.010
Who? Elena?

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:14.930
Sakura... Sakura!

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:17.300
That's right! The match...!

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:19.390
Sakura...!

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:22.140
I... I...

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:27.110
I...

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.070
lost.

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:31.150
Sakura...

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.360
I'm sorry, Elena...

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:34.990
I...

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:43.500
Now then, you better keep your promise!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:44.710
Promise?

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:48.750
I told you. <i>Cabellera Contra Cabellera.</i>

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:53.510
It means to put our
hair in risk for the match!

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:57.640
This is a hair versus hair death match!

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.050
Stop being silly!

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:01.970
Sakura's hair is a symbol
of her life as an idol!

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:04.850
- She can't lose it for something like this.
- "Something like this?" Hah!

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:08.440
So I guess your
resolve was nothing after all.

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:11.480
I accept... the promise to risk my hair.

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:13.360
Sakura!

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:15.950
I lost.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:18.660
Whatever happens, I can't complain.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.030
Sakura!

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:23.830
Oh, looks like you've
got some spirit in you.

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:37.760
Hey... look...

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:45.060
This is frustrating...

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:47.440
It's not about my hair being cut.

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:50.900
It's frustrating that I
wasn't able to do anything!

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:55.990
I lost... That's the end of my wrestling...

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:58.070
But... what is this?

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:02.080
This feeling rising inside of me...

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:05.700
Now then...

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:07.290
That should do it.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.620
If you've had enough,
you stinking idols better not

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:12.460
think of fooling around like this again!

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:13.210
Sakura!

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:15.090
- Sakura-<i>chan</i>!
- Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:17.300
Don't let this bother you, okay?

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:19.930
Put this stupid thing behind you!

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:24.010
You just have to come back tomorrow
as an idol, like you were before.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:25.680
Sounds best.

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:31.350
You're better fit going easy as an
idol on stage than standing in a ring.

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:35.190
Go back to your lame Sweet Diva group...

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:38.860
and have fun playing
stupid games with your friends!

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:41.910
Sakura...

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.200
It's okay if it's about me.

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:47.910
But I can't take anyone
making fun of Sweet Diva!

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.540
One more time...

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:51.250
I challenge you, one more time!

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:52.670
Are you an idiot?

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:55.090
You saw what happened here.

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:58.630
An amateur like you isn't in
the league to step in here anymore!

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:01.840
As long as I'm not an
amateur, then it's okay, right?

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:03.970
I'm going to go pro!

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:06.560
I'll become a professional
wrestler, and beat you!

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:08.850
What?!

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:10.640
Now it's getting interesting!

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:13.100
Th-This is some news!

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:17.610
Star idol, Sakura Hagiwara, made a surprise
announcement to become a pro wrestler!

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:20.650
Yes! Please change the
entire front page article!

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:23.990
The headline's going to read, "Sakura
Hagiwara's Move to Pro Wrestling!"

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:27.790
Yes! The top idol,
Sweet Diva's center vocal

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:30.870
is going to challenge
the world of pro wrestling!

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:35.790
Sakura...

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:42.930
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:45.680
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:21:45.890 --> 00:21:50.430
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:53.310
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:57.820 --> 00:22:02.990
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:08.620
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:14.080
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:18.130
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:22:18.340 --> 00:22:19.250
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:21.920
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:22:22.130 --> 00:22:24.590
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:22:24.800 --> 00:22:31.970
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:22:32.180 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:39.320
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:22:39.520 --> 00:22:40.940
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:49.030
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.660
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:54.620
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:54.830 --> 00:22:55.870
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:56.080 --> 00:22:57.420
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:57.630 --> 00:22:59.920
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:23:00.130 --> 00:23:01.380
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:23:01.590 --> 00:23:04.970
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:07.800
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:23:10.600 --> 00:23:12.640
Chief! I've got a big scoop for you!

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:35.260
Episode 02: Pro Debut!

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:15.640
The national idol, Sakura Hagiwara
is going to debut as a pro wrestler!

00:23:15.850 --> 00:23:19.690
It seems like there's some
unreal test going on at Berserk!

00:23:19.900 --> 00:23:23.480
I can already feel a frail
idol's faint voice echoing again!

00:23:23.690 --> 00:23:25.650
Seems like the debut
match is already set too!

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:27.490
No telling what's going to happen!

00:23:27.700 --> 00:23:30.620
Well, to be honest, as long as
things get exciting, it's all okay!

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:34.620
So, Sakura-<i>chan</i>? Don't get
knocked out in an instant, okay?

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:40.230
A request from Sakura:

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:40.230
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
